<title>NORWAY: Norsk Hydro sees weaker fertilisers in H1.</title>
<headline>Norsk Hydro sees weaker fertilisers in H1.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Industrial giant Norsk Hydro ASA said on Monday it expected European fertiliser prices to be weaker in the first half of 1997 due to increased production and high imports.</p>
<p>Hydro said the European fertiliser market was expected to be favourably influenced by the European Union parliament's decision to reduce the set-aside acreage from 10 percent to five percent.</p>
